{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3D4nTmmDE7U6UdkUzG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't get the terms of Allstate's Junior Subordinated Debentures with these tools. The search tool tells me which filings contain a phrase, but it can't show me the text around it. So I can't confirm the principal amount, coupon, maturity, call dates, interest-deferral rights or covenants.\n\n**What the searches did establish (keyword matches only):**\n- Allstate's FY2024 10-K, filed 24 Feb 2025, does mention \"junior subordinated debentures\". So the instrument was still part of the capital structure being described at year-end 2024.\n- That same 10-K also contains the words \"2053\", \"SOFR\", \"2.938%\", \"Term SOFR\", \"replacement capital covenant\" and \"10 years\". The search only shows these words appear somewhere in the document, not that they describe the debentures. That fits a fixed-to-floating debenture due 2053 that now pays a Term SOFR-based rate plus a margin of about 2.938% and carries a replacement capital covenant. Treat that as unconfirmed until the debt note is read.\n- The phrase \"5.750%\" appears with \"junior subordinated debentures\" in the FY2023 10-K, its Exhibit 4.2 (Allstate's description of its registered securities), a 2024 S-3ASR and 2024 debt prospectuses. It does not appear in the FY2024 10-K. That suggests a fixed 5.750% coupon was the original rate and has since switched to floating, but that is my inference.\n- The structured financial data (XBRL) had nothing either way: the queries for \"JuniorSubordinatedNotes\" and \"SubordinatedDebt\" came back \"not found\".\n\nTo get the actual terms, read the long-term debt note (\"Capital Structure\" or \"Debt\") in the FY2024 10-K, or Exhibit 4.2 from the FY2023 10-K.\n\n**Sources**\n- Allstate Corp 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-02-24, accession 0000899051-25-000015 (all-20241231.htm)\n- Allstate Corp 10-K for FY2023, filed 2024-02-21, accession 0000899051-24-000013 (all-20231231.htm and exhibit42-allcorpdescripti.htm)\n- Allstate Corp S-3ASR, filed 2024-04-30, accession 0001628280-24-019336\n- Allstate Corp 424B2 prospectuses, filed 2024-06-18 (accession 0001628280-24-028684) and 2024-06-21 (accession 0001628280-24-029201)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1135,"cache_read_input_tokens":9053,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1135},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1dcd4577-6c79-4ff9-b155-5cfa9db7624d","uuid":"393b3a9a-ef41-4037-a568-6ccd905947cc","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:12:40.526Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ3D4VMDDoFo3fyDpbzu"}
